# N2a: the rig at id's perspective span, 16 pixels. The divide rig: e1m6's corridor from
# (504,500,242), a linear turn from yaw 104 down at 0.778 degrees a second, no status bar,
# slop at 1920x1080. N2a, N2b, N2c and PER4 are the same turn; the film cuts each where
# its line falls.
#
# Under V3-42, "One last switch, and it's subtle.", and V3-44a, "id's renderer divided
# once every sixteen pixels, and drew straight lines in between."

map e1m6

duration 40.1
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_perspspan 16

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,104.7778  ease linear
key 40.1  504,500,242  0,73.5889

sound on
events on
